{
  "pack": "prospectforge-base",
  "manifestVersion": 2,
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-02",
  "manifestChangelog": "2026-10-02 release: brain-survey 1.0.0, mentee-project 0.1.0 and brain-status 0.1.0 join the pack as folder components. 2026-10-02 release: ferryman 1.3.1 (User-Agent on every call, the Cloudflare 1010 fix; BRAIN_ROOT override). 2026-09-23 release: brain-viewer 0.48.0 (The viewer is now a pf-pack component, replaced whole on update, and what you make lives outside it. Your settings, board layouts, looks and widgets live in viewer/ at the brain root, which no update). 2026-09-23 release: brain-viewer 0.48.0 (The viewer is now a pf-pack component, replaced whole on update, and what you make lives outside it. Your settings, board layouts, looks and widgets live in viewer/ at the brain root, which no update). 2026-09-23 release: update 1.1.0 (folder components: install-component.py replaces a component folder whole; the Brain Viewer ships as one). 2026-09-03 release: ferryman 1.3.0 (push.py was sending a `source` key the import schema rejects 422, so every 1.2.0 push failed at validate -- removed; --participants ships as a frontmatter YAML list; --base flag; runbook example corrected; participants matrix row LIVE). 2026-08-28 release: ferryman 1.2.0 (PATCH correction path, API catalog, owner rules, Topics trap, participants gap documented), transcript-processor 1.2.1 (owner rules + corrected push facts + verbatim check), people-adapter 1.0.1 (career-arc facet), shell v0.2 (standing reminders folded into current-focus, dispatcher-cursor dropped, Ferret reference removed). v2 (2026-07-28): per-skill files[] mappings (src in this repo -> dest in a brain) so the assembler can build a new brain straight from the registry; shell component versioned; update-skill + ferryman-adapter-contract now bundled. All v1 fields unchanged — /update keeps working.",
  "shell": {
    "component": "brain-shell",
    "version": "0.2",
    "changelog": "v0.2 (2026-08-28): standing reminders live in the 📌 section of context/current-focus.md (standing-reminders.md dropped); dispatcher-cursor.md dropped (a dispatcher install creates its own); Ferret removed from the sync-adapter list; 4-state-file pattern documented in context/readme.md. v0.1: structure default (folder skeleton + per-folder readmes + SETUP/SHELL/WHAT-YOU-GET + CLAUDE.md with {{INHABITANT}} placeholders), cast 2026-07-09.",
    "source": "local:brain-shell (resolved by assemble-brain.py on the maintainer machine; informational only)",
    "sourceUrl": null,
    "note": "Assembler clones this, then installs the skills below. Versioned here so structure updates can propagate like skill updates. Phase 2: host the shell + serve via GET /api/v1/pack."
